id: pm-rl-tvo2
title: Remove ignored manifest metadata and adopt pm CLI/SDK 2026.8.20
description: "The published 2026.8.20 SDK reports manifest_unknown_key for pm-rl because manifest.json retains an inert legacy pm object. The package also uses permissive old dev and peer ranges, so its tests do not prove the current SDK contract."
