resolution: Adopted pm CLI SDK 2026.8.20 and repaired stricter read and dependency contracts
expected_result: "Manifest compatibility has zero findings, current dependencies audit cleanly, intentional dangling edges are explicit, and metric history remains complete under universal output bounds"
actual_result: "Raw manifest check returns no findings; npm audit reports zero vulnerabilities; 10,000-event acceptance reads unbounded history; exact all-source coverage is 100/100/100"
